<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>能交给确定性判的，绝不靠模型自觉</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 420, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>确定性优先</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.65}}>能重跑、能审计的判定，<br />优先于任何模型意见。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 708, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "MONO", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>可复现 · 可审计</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 14}}>测试　·　lint　·　类型　·　schema</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "MONO", fontSize: 20, color: "#A32D2D"}}>不可审计</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 14}}>AI review / 模型判断——换个时间可能换结论</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 6}}>模型判断只做兜底，不做门禁。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>17 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
